      "value": "@{5da2f04f83044212974c5061|full_name}: idk how well that'd work but could maybe help tbh (also nice to see you again lol) people that're dedicated enough can remove the watermark and even replace it as ive had that happen to me before where someone tried to say i was the one who ripped and even went out of their way to get others mad at me for \"ripping\" even though it was them who ripped sadly\n\nthe best way to go about avatars imo is only use the ones you care about with people that're trustable to not do something such as ripping but even then they could still rip it and be malicious",
