  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I had an idea, would it be possible to have a button so that my avatar is only shown to a group of people I trust?, by default everyone can see everyone’s avatar from the visitor to friends but I thought it would be interesting using the rank as a way to see people’s avatars, for example there would be an avatar and it could only be shown from people who have the “USERS” rank, this would be interesting because most of the rippers are of the “NEW” rank and I I would be able to prevent an account that was created 1 minute ago from stealing the avatar (I know it wouldn’t prevent it but it would be much more difficult to rip it off) In this case, for those with the “new” rank, either a standard avatar or another avatar selected by the user would come.",
